    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Uku ni ko Umwami Uwiteka avuga ngo: Irembo ry'urugo ry'imbere ryerekeye iburasirazuba rijye ryugarirwa mu minsi itandatu y'umurimo, ariko ku munsi w'isabato ryugururwe, kandi ryugururwe no ku munsi wa mbere ukwezi kwabonetseho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami ajye yinjira anyuze mu nzira yo kw'ibaraza ry'irembo ry'inyuma, maze ahagarare iruhande rw'igikingi cy'irembo, abatambyi batambe igitambo cye cyoswa, n'igitambo cye cy'uko ari amahoro, maze asengere mu bikingi by'amarembo ahereko ahave, ariko iryo rembo rye kugarirwa kugeza nimugoroba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi rubanda rwo mu gihugu rujye rusengera Uwiteka imbere y'iryo rembo ku masabato no mu mboneko z'ukwezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Igitambo cyoswa umwami azajya atambirira Uwiteka ku munsi w'isabato, ni abana b'intama badafite inenge batandatu n'isekurume y'intama idafite inenge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ituro ry'ifu ku bw'isekurume y'intama ribe efa imwe, n'ituro ry'ifu ku bw'abana b'intama ribe nk'uko ashaka, n'amavuta ya elayo hini imwe ku bwa efa y'ifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ku munsi wa mbere ukwezi kwabonetseho, azajye atanga ikimasa kidafite inenge n'abana b'intama batandatu, n'isekurume y'intama bidafite inenge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi atange n'ituro ry'ifu, ku bw'ikimasa efa imwe, na efa imwe ku bw'isekurume y'intama, no ku bw'abana b'intama nk'uko ashaka, n'amavuta ya elayo hini imwe ku bwa efa y'ifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi umwami niyinjira ajye anyura mu nzira yo kw'ibaraza ry'irembo, iyo nzira abe ari yo asohokeramo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ariko rubanda rwo mu gihugu niruza imbere y'Uwiteka mu minsi y'ibirori byabo byera, uzinjira anyuze mu nzira y'irembo ryerekeye ikasikazi aje gusenga, azatunguke mu nzira yo ku irembo ryerekeye ikusi, kandi uzinjira anyuze mu nzira y'irembo ryerekeye ikusi, azatunguke mu nzira y'irembo ryerekeye ikasikazi, ntazatunguke mu nzira y'irembo yinjiriyemo, ahubwo azaromboreze imbere ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi umwami ajye yinjirana na bo binjiye, nibasohoka asohokane na bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu minsi y'ibirori no mu minsi mikuru, ituro ry'ifu rijye riba efa imwe ku bw'ikimasa, na efa imwe ku bw'isekurume y'intama, no ku bw'abana b'intama nk'uko ashaka, n'amavuta ya elayo hini imwe ku bwa efa y'ifu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Kandi igihe umwami azaturira Uwiteka igitambo abyishakiye, ari igitambo cyoswa cyangwa igitambo cy'uko ari amahoro, azugururirwe irembo ryerekeye iburasirazuba, atambe igitambo cye cyoswa n'ibitambo bye by'uko ari amahoro, nk'uko ajya agenza ku munsi w'isabato maze asohoke, namara guhita irembo ryugarirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Kandi nawe ujye utambirira Uwiteka umwana w'intama, umaze umwaka umwe kandi udafite inenge ho igitambo cyoswa iminsi yose, ujye uwutamba uko bukeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi uwutangane n'ituro ry'ifu uko bukeye, kimwe cya gatandatu cya efa imwe, na kimwe cya gatatu cya hini y'amavuta ya elayo yo gutosa iyo fu nziza. Uko ni ko ituro ry'ifu riturwa Uwiteka rizaba rimeze. Ni itegeko ritazakuka iteka ryose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ni ko bazajya batanga n'umwana w'intama, n'ituro ry'ifu, n'amavuta ya elayo uko bukeye, kuba igitambo cyoswa gihoraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Uku ni ko Umwami Uwiteka avuga ngo: Umwami nagira icyo aha umwe wo mu bahungu be cy'ubuntu, kizaba gakondo ye, kibe icy'abahungu be babe bene cyo, kuko ari gakondo yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lewi 25.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariko nagira icyo aha umwe mu bagaragu be agikuye muri gakondo ye, kizaba ari icye kugeza mu mwaka wo gukomorerwa, maze gisubizwe umwami, ariko gakondo ye izaba iy'abahungu be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi umwami ntagatware gakondo ya rubanda ku rugomo ngo abavane muri gakondo yabo, ahubwo ajye aha abahungu be ibyo akuye muri gakondo ye bwite, kugira ngo ubwoko bwanjye budatatana, umuntu wese akava muri gakondo ye.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze anjyana ahanyurwa h'iruhande rw'irembo, angeza mu twumba twera tw'abatambyi twerekeye ikasikazi, mpabona ahantu hari hirya, herekeye iburengerazuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arambwira ati “Hariya hantu ni ho abatambyi bazajya bateka igitambo gikuraho urubanza n'ikindi gitambo gitambirirwa ibyaha, kandi ni ho bazajya botsa ituro ry'ifu, kugira ngo batabijyana hanze mu rugo rw'inyuma babyejesha rubanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze anjyana mu rugo rw'inyuma, anyuza mu matako ane y'urugo, ndebye mbona ku matako y'inkike yose y'urugo hari ingombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu matako ane y'urugo hari ingombe zizitiweho, uburebure bwazo ari mikono mirongo ine, n'ubugari bwazo mikono mirongo itatu, zose uko ziri mu matako ane yazo zihwanije urugero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izo ngombe imbere yazo uko ari enye hari hakikije inkike, muri izo nkike hari amaziko impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:24"
          },
